        "merged_at": "2024-04-30T11:36:57Z"
      },
      "body": "This PR extends rune with the functionality to emit warnings when deprecated functions are used.\r\nWhen possible the deprecation warning is created while compilation.\r\nFor instance and field functions the warning will only be created/emitted when the VM has a shared Diagnostic struct set. If this diagnostic has not been set, the runtime performance will not be affected.",
